
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "RefundPolicy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <div class="bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm">
                <h2 class="mb-4 text-center text-primary">Refund & Fee Policy</h2>

                <h4 class="text-dark mb-3">Fee Policy</h4>
                <ol class="text-dark">
                    <li>School fees are to be paid by Cash/ Cheque/ DDs. Cheques/DDs should be drawn in the name of Iqra Educational Institute.</li>
                    <li>Fees are payable in installments as prescribed by the school only on or before the scheduled dates.</li>
                    <li>Fees for the entire academic year can be paid together at the time of admission.</li>
                    <li>Once paid, fees are non-transferable / non-adjustable / non-refundable under any circumstances and are subject to the exceptions as set out in the refund policy.</li>
                    <li>If admission is cancelled midterm, no dues should be left pending. Leaving Certificate will be issued only after full settlement of dues. Withdrawal applications must be submitted a minimum of 60 working days before term end.</li>
                    <li>Service Tax and other statutory taxes should be paid separately, wherever applicable.</li>
                    <li>If any cheque is dishonored, the management may de-enroll the student and apply penalties as it deems fit.</li>
                    <li>Students with unpaid fees will not be allowed to sit for Board exams. Results, certificates, or references will not be issued to such students or parents.</li>
                    <li>If fees are unpaid for 30 days after the due date, the student’s name may be struck off school records.</li>
                    <li>The school reserves the right to revise/amend the Fee Schedule at any time.</li>
                </ol>

                <h4 class="text-dark mt-5 mb-3">Fee Refund Policy</h4>
                <ol class="text-dark">
                    <li>Admission and Registration fees once paid are non-refundable under any circumstances, even if admission is withdrawn before classes begin or during the academic year.</li>
                    <li>Security deposits are adjustable against damages and will be refunded (without interest) after all dues are settled upon withdrawal or course completion.</li>
                    <li>
                        If a student withdraws before the term starts, refund (if applicable) will be via cheque:
                        <ul>
                            <li>If withdrawal is more than 60 working days before term starts: Tuition & Term Fees will be refunded.</li>
                            <li>If less than 60 working days: Tuition & Term Fees will be payable (non-refundable).</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>After the academic year has commenced, no fees will be refunded under any circumstances. All pending dues must be cleared, even if the student doesn’t attend.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

